{
  "id": "PRO.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 26",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As snow in summer, and as rain in harvest, so honour is not seemly for a fool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the bird by wandering, as the swallow by flying, so the curse causeless shall not come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A whip for the horse, a bridle for the ass, and a rod for the fool's back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Answer not a fool according to his folly, lest thou also be like unto him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Answer a fool according to his folly, lest he be wise in his own conceit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that sendeth a message by the hand of a fool cutteth off the feet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "drinketh damage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The legs of the lame are not equal: so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a parable in the mouth of fools.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As he that bindeth a stone in a sling, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that giveth honour to a fool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a thorn goeth up into the hand of a drunkard, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a parable in the mouth of fools.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The great",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "God",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that formed all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "both rewardeth the fool, and rewardeth transgressors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a dog returneth to his vomit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a fool returneth to his folly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seest thou a man wise in his own conceit?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "more hope of a fool than of him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The slothful",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saith,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a lion in the way; a lion",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the streets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the door turneth upon his hinges, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "doth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the slothful upon his bed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The slothful hideth his hand in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bosom; it grieveth him to bring it again to his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sluggard",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wiser in his own conceit than seven men that can render a reason.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that passeth by,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meddleth with strife",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "belonging",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not to him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.26.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one that taketh a dog by the ears.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a mad",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
